# Byte-stability of the archived evidence across platforms.
# Text files are checked out with LF everywhere, so the raw bytes of the
# repository copy match the digests recorded in evidence/ on every machine
# (see orvyren.decision.scenarios.corpus_sha256 and
# orvyren.audit.dossier.sha256_file, which additionally LF-normalise on read).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Real binaries: never touched.
*.png binary
*.sqlite binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
